1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:10,500
This is the teacher view of Kiddy. Sign in
with the daycare account your manager gave
you, and the app opens on your own
dashboard.

2
00:00:10,500 --> 00:00:22,078
The dashboard is your morning start. It
shows the children in your classrooms, who
is checked in now, open consents, and the
latest reports.

3
00:00:22,078 --> 00:00:32,778
Children lists every child in the
classrooms assigned to you. Search by
name, filter by status, or open a child
profile.

4
00:00:32,778 --> 00:00:42,245
The daily report is the heart of the child
profile. Pick the date, record the meal,
mood, sleep, toilet, and a note, then save
it for the family.

5
00:00:42,245 --> 00:00:52,045
About shows the child's room, date of
birth, allergies, and care notes, so you
have the important facts before the day
starts.

6
00:00:52,045 --> 00:01:03,479
Family holds the parents and pickup
contacts, with phone, email, and pickup
permission. Your manager controls who can
collect the child.

7
00:01:03,479 --> 00:01:13,413
Media keeps the photos and videos you
share with the family. Upload from your
device, and parents see it in their app.

8
00:01:13,413 --> 00:01:21,852
Documents shows the consent requests sent
for this child, with the parent's answer
and the date.

9
00:01:21,852 --> 00:01:30,286
Schedules shows the child's weekly plan,
so you know which days they attend and
which activities are planned.

10
00:01:30,286 --> 00:01:39,420
Learning history collects your
observations and assessments for this
child, in one timeline you can revisit.

11
00:01:39,420 --> 00:01:48,187
Incidents shows every incident linked to
this child, with what happened, who
reported it, and the parent's
acknowledgement.

12
00:01:48,187 --> 00:01:57,454
Attendance is your classroom register.
Choose the day, filter by room, search for
a child, then check them in or out. The
bus buttons show who is on the bus.

13
00:01:57,454 --> 00:02:07,421
Send a consent request to one child or the
whole classroom. The list shows who
approved, who denied, and who has not
answered yet.

14
00:02:07,421 --> 00:02:16,221
The Incidents page lists reports for your
classrooms. Open one to read the details
and see whether the parent has
acknowledged it.

15
00:02:16,221 --> 00:02:26,927
The newsfeed is how you talk to families.
Write a post, choose a child, a classroom,
or all families, add a photo, and publish.

16
00:02:26,927 --> 00:02:38,764
Messages is your private inbox. Start a
thread with a parent or a classroom,
attach a file, and keep every reply
together.

17
00:02:38,764 --> 00:02:45,298
Calendar shows the center's events and
field trips for the month, with the media
shared for each one.

18
00:02:45,298 --> 00:02:56,311
Create an event from the Events page. Add
the title, date, time, place, and the
families who should see it.

19
00:02:56,311 --> 00:03:05,578
Parent drive shares a file with one family
or with all families. Upload it once, and
it appears in the parent app.

20
00:03:05,578 --> 00:03:15,178
Learning is where you record development.
Choose a child, pick a curriculum area,
write what you observed, and add it to
their history.

21
00:03:15,178 --> 00:03:24,312
Activities covers the fun part of the day.
Create an activity with a time, a place,
and an audience, and parents get the
update.

22
00:03:24,312 --> 00:03:33,279
Homework lets you assign a task to one
child or the whole classroom, with a due
date and clear instructions.

23
00:03:33,279 --> 00:03:42,279
Your staff profile shows your role, your
rooms, and your contact details. Your
manager keeps the team list up to date.

24
00:03:42,279 --> 00:03:49,946
Staff schedule shows your weekly shifts,
so you always know when you are expected
in your classroom.

25
00:03:49,946 --> 00:03:56,051
Working hours shows the center opening
times and the rooms you can access.

26
00:03:56,051 --> 00:04:05,128
Notifications collects messages, reports,
and activity. Open an item to jump
straight to the child or the conversation.

27
00:04:05,128 --> 00:04:13,797
In Account settings you can change your
photo, your password, your app language,
and your push notifications.

28
00:04:13,797 --> 00:04:21,397
That is the teacher workspace: every
child, every daily record, and every
message home, in one place.

